Hansaens raad.
{%+:12}

column2:
Patrol destination

The next destination on my intended trade route is {%t:00}. So get your ship, {%s:08}, to {%t:00} as soon as possible.

{%N:06}

column3:
Patruljemaal

Naeste maal paa min planlagte handelsrute er {%t:00}. Send derfor jeres skib {%s:08} til {%t:00} hurtigst muligt.

{%N:06}

column2:
So where are you? I told you to set off soon. In the meantime, my enemies must have thought that my convoy had sunk long since and will have sailed off somewhere else.
So I really don't think you deserve a reward.

{%N:06}

column3:
Hvor bliver I af? Jeg sagde, at I skulle tage af sted snart. I mellemtiden har mine fjender sikkert troet, at min konvoj for laengst var sunket, og er sejlet et andet sted hen.
Jeg mener altsaa virkelig ikke, at I fortjener en beloenning.

{%N:06}

column2:
So where are you? I told you to set off soon. In the meantime, my enemies must have thought that my convoy had sunk long since and will have sailed off somewhere else.
So I consider {%c:09} to be ample payment for your trouble.

{%N:06}

column3:
Hvor bliver I af? Jeg sagde, at I skulle tage af sted snart. I mellemtiden har mine fjender sikkert troet, at min konvoj for laengst var sunket, og er sejlet et andet sted hen.
Jeg anser derfor {%c:09} for rigelig betaling for ulejligheden.

